 "read_problems": [
  "Unit column \"Bedrooms & Baths, Etc.\" gives type codes (e.g. \"3 BD/3\", \"1 BD/1\", \"4 BD/3.5/T\") rather than separate beds/baths columns; I parsed bedroom count and bathroom count from these codes where shown, using \"-\" when only bedroom count given (no bath number printed, e.g. \"1A\" row \"1/2/HO\" and several \"BD\" entries without explicit bath digit like \"3 BD/3\" interpreted as 3 bath). Table has no separate common-charge/tax monthly dollar columns tied per-unit on this page (only annual estimated common charges, taxes, and carrying charges are shown, not monthly per-unit cc_m/tax_m/carry_m matching schema fields, so I filled \"-\" throughout). Unit \"1A\" row shows \"1/2/HO\" in description column with no price/sq ft data — likely a non-saleable unit (storage/HO), left price/sf as read.",
  "Page 52 contains a Schedule A financial table but is cropped so the column headers and the interior square footage (int_sf) column are not visible; only unit number, room-type code, percentage columns, and eight unlabeled dollar columns appear, making it impossible to reliably determine beds/baths, int_sf, ext_sf, and which dollar columns correspond to cc_m, tax_m, and carry_m without guessing.",
  "Page 53 contains only \"Notes to Schedule A\" text, no price table."
